OL,3,GNEWSAReligious leader 'hijacked'
OL,4,Amovement, claims brother
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I did not see any of this stuff
OL,7,Fcoming. I tried to talk to him several
OL,8,Ftimes, tried to advise him. He would
OL,9,Fjust accuse me of being jealous of
OL,10,Fhim."
OL,12,FAbdelRahman Hashem's brother, Abdullah
OL,13,FHashem, is a self-proclaimed Mahdi, or
OL,14,Fsaviour of mankind, and leader of The
OL,15,FAhmadi Religion of Peace and Light
OL,16,F(AROPL), now based in Crewe, Cheshire.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
