OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAReligious leader 'hijacked'
OL,4,Amovement, claims brother
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an interview with BBC File on 4
OL,7,FInvestigates, Hashem's brother claims
OL,8,Fhe, "kind of hijacked some other
OL,9,Fpeople's religious movement and kind of
OL,10,Fmade it his own. I know Abdullah better
OL,11,Fthan most people. I don't think he
OL,12,Fbelieves he is the Mahdi."
OL,14,FThe BBC put this to Abdullah Hashem's
OL,15,Flawyer who said it was "false and
OL,16,Fhighly damaging to suggest that Mr
OL,17,FHashem doesn't believe himself to be
OL,18,Fthe Mahdi" and his brother was trying
OL,19,Fto "undermine" him.
